    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a pause though. it feels more like a bankruptcy. i spent my entire youth, my energy, my mental health... all of it on something that just evaporated. i keep looking at the math of it and it doesn't add up. how am i supposed to just \"forge something new\" when the foundation is completely gone? i feel like i'm just a hollow shell of a person now. there's nothing left to build with.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
