    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so exhausting to even hear that. \"survival is the first structure\"... but what if i'm just tired of surviving? it feels like i've been playing a game where the rules keep changing and i've lost everything i put in. at some point, don't you just stop playing? it feels like the only logical way to stop the loss is to just walk away from the table entirely.",
